---
description: Team rules for all agents in this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before any action. It is the single source of truth:

- `<member>/<topic>` branches only, never `main`;
- no Co-authored-by or attribution lines;
- no data or large files;
- no external data or APIs;
- stay in the paths your member owns;
- write a handover and status update at the end of each session.
